<title>JAPAN: Autobacs says to buy back 3.8 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Autobacs says to buy back 3.8 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Autobacs Seven Co Ltd, an Osaka-based maker of car parts, said on Monday it has decided to buy back up to 3.8 million of its own shares.</p>
<p>The company said the move needs to be approved by its annual shareholders' meeting scheduled for later this year.</p>
</text>
